sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant Client as Browser/API client
  participant MW as RequestLoggingMiddleware
  participant Django as Django application
  participant Log as Console logger
  participant Render as Render log stream
  participant Sentry as Sentry SDK
  participant GA as Google Analytics
  participant VA as Vercel Analytics

  Client->>MW: HTTPS request
  MW->>Django: Continue request
  Django-->>MW: Response or exception
  MW->>Log: Request ID, path, status, duration, IP/user context
  Log->>Render: stdout/stderr stream

  Django->>Sentry: Exception/event when DSN configured
  Note over Sentry: before_send removes selected query values such as api_key/token; complete header/body scrubbing is not established.
  Sentry-->>Django: SDK capture result

  Client->>GA: Browser analytics only after consent
  Client->>VA: Vercel Analytics component mounted unconditionally

  Note over MW,Log: Logs can contain IP, user ID/username, user-agent and recipient email from email helper paths.
  Note over Client,VA: Vercel Analytics is not gated by the local consent manager in App.jsx.
